  "prefLabel": "Env-A 2802.01 Affected equipment",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 2802.01 “Affected equipment” means each crusher, grinding mill, screening operation, bucket elevator, belt conveyor, bagging operation, storage bin, and enclosed truck or railcar loading station at an affected facility, as well as each crusher and grinding mill at hot mix asphalt facilities that reduce the size of nonmetallic minerals embedded in recycled asphalt pavement.\n\nSource. #9793, eff 10-1-10; ss by #12693, eff 12-22-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a2800.html"
